<title>USA: June flows to US stock funds est. at $18.0 bln-ICI.</title>
<headline>June flows to US stock funds est. at $18.0 bln-ICI.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimated net flows to stock mutual funds were $18.0 billion in June, down from inflows of $20.1 billion in May, a trade group said Thursday.</p>
<p>The Investment Company Institute said the estimated inflow to bond and income funds was $2.5 billion in June after net inflows of $2.8 billion in May.</p>
<p>The monthly estimates are derived from unpublished weekly estimates based on a survey of long-term funds that account for about 97 percent of long-term mutual fund assets, ICI said.</p>
</text>
